        "inlines": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "Connectors can be configured with transformations to make lightweight per message modifications. Debezium provides several "
          },
          {
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "single message transformations"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "link",
            "target": "https://kafka.apache.org/documentation/#connect_transforms"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " (SMTs) that you can use to either modify records before they are sent to Apache Kafka (by applying them to the Debezium connectors), or when they are read from Kafka by a sink connector. Also "
          },
          {
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Debezium Server"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "xref",
            "target": "operations/debezium-server.html"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " supports the usage of SMTs."
          }
        ],
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "context": "paragraph",
        "id": null,
        "inlines": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "The following SMTs are provided by Debezium:"
          }
        ],
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
