                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "A transformation that reduces the size of VGTIDs that the Vitess connector emits. To reduce the amount of data in the event message, the SMT writes only the VGTID for the shard in which a change occurs. The VGTIDs for other shards are removed. This transformation is designed for use only with the Debezium connector for Vitess."
